      <item>
        <title>RT by @GoogleDeepMind: Here’s a first look at Gemini Robotics 2 from @GoogleDeepMind on the FR3 Duo: 20 minutes of uninterrupted, real-time tool kitting. Notice the emergent recovery behaviours - generalized dexterity &amp; precision at a whole new level. More demos dropping over the next days! Stay tuned!</title>
        <dc:creator>@bousmalis</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>Here’s a first look at Gemini Robotics 2 from <a href="https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind" title="Google DeepMind">@GoogleDeepMind</a> on the FR3 Duo: 20 minutes of uninterrupted, real-time tool kitting.<br>
<br>
Notice the emergent recovery behaviours - generalized dexterity & precision at a whole new level. <br>
<br>
More demos dropping over the next days! Stay tuned!</p>
