      <item>
        <title>R to @GoogleDeepMind: To be truly useful, a robot needs the dexterity that humans take for granted. But asking AI models to coordinate these motions is incredibly complicated. In this demo, we pushed Apollo 2 to master fine motor skills and complete tricky kitchen chores ↓</title>
        <dc:creator>@GoogleDeepMind</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>To be truly useful, a robot needs the dexterity that humans take for granted. But asking AI models to coordinate these motions is incredibly complicated.<br>
<br>
In this demo, we pushed Apollo 2 to master fine motor skills and complete tricky kitchen chores ↓</p>
<a href="https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind/status/2082904278461469091#m">
<br>Video<br>
  <img src="https://nitter.net/pic/amplify_video_thumb%2F2082903401789001729%2Fimg%2FERGitghxwfO99T7u.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />
</a>]]></description>
