      <item>
        <title>R to @GoogleDeepMind: Teamwork makes the dream work. To test multi-robot collaboration with Gemini Robotics 2, we challenged our Apollo and Duo robots to tidy up a messy garage. The high-level reasoning model breaks down what to do, where to go, and identifies the exact moment to hand over control ↓ https://goo.gle/4h5N7CQ</title>
        <dc:creator>@GoogleDeepMind</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>Teamwork makes the dream work.<br>
<br>
To test multi-robot collaboration with Gemini Robotics 2, we challenged our Apollo and Duo robots to tidy up a messy garage. The high-level reasoning model breaks down what to do, where to go, and identifies the exact moment to hand over control ↓ <a href="https://goo.gle/4h5N7CQ">goo.gle/4h5N7CQ</a></p>
<a href="https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind/status/2082904281838227562#m">
