      <item>
        <title>One brain. For any robot. 🤖 We’re launching Gemini Robotics 2: our next-generation physical AI bringing full body intelligence to humanoids, advanced dexterity, multi-robot teamwork and more.</title>
        <dc:creator>@GoogleDeepMind</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>One brain. For any robot. 🤖<br>
<br>
We’re launching Gemini Robotics 2: our next-generation physical AI bringing full body intelligence to humanoids, advanced dexterity, multi-robot teamwork and more.</p>
<a href="https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind/status/2082844162928381956#m">
<br>Video<br>
  <img src="https://nitter.net/pic/amplify_video_thumb%2F2082842377991933952%2Fimg%2FsR12pig4K7ksJ1FC.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />
</a>]]></description>
