        <link>https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind/status/2082844162928381956#m</link>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title>R to @GoogleDeepMind: Gemini Robotics 2 moves physical AI beyond tabletop tasks, enabling intelligent whole-body control for humanoids. Watch @Apptronik&apos;s Apollo 2 process a single prompt to reach, bend, and pick up a watering can ↓</title>
        <dc:creator>@GoogleDeepMind</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>Gemini Robotics 2 moves physical AI beyond tabletop tasks, enabling intelligent whole-body control for humanoids.<br>
<br>
Watch <a href="https://nitter.net/Apptronik" title="Apptronik">@Apptronik</a>'s Apollo 2 process a single prompt to reach, bend, and pick up a watering can ↓</p>
<a href="https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind/status/2082844168154435957#m">
<br>Video<br>
  <img src="https://nitter.net/pic/amplify_video_thumb%2F2082842601078591489%2Fimg%2FrlI7CM0wsswsnLM6.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />
</a>]]></description>
        <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 15:02:01 GMT</pubDate>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">2082844168154435957</guid>
        <link>https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind/status/2082844168154435957#m</link>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title>R to @GoogleDeepMind: To be genuinely useful in our homes and workplaces, robots need finesse. Gemini Robotics 2 equips different hardware platforms with high dexterity. It can control a five-fingered hand to tie a knot or screw in a lightbulb - while also managing parallel grippers for complex packing tasks. We’re additionally introducing multi-robot collaboration so completely different types of robots can communicate and work together to solve problems a single robot couldn’t do alone. 🤝 Find out more → https://goo.gle/3Tvi61l</title>
        <dc:creator>@GoogleDeepMind</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>To be genuinely useful in our homes and workplaces, robots need finesse.<br>
<br>
Gemini Robotics 2 equips different hardware platforms with high dexterity. It can control a five-fingered hand to tie a knot or screw in a lightbulb - while also managing parallel grippers for complex packing tasks.<br>
<br>
We’re additionally introducing multi-robot collaboration so completely different types of robots can communicate and work together to solve problems a single robot couldn’t do alone. 🤝<br>
<br>
Find out more → <a href="https://goo.gle/3Tvi61l">goo.gle/3Tvi61l</a></p>
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHOe_LfAWwAA__0J.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />]]></description>
        <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 15:02:02 GMT</pubDate>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">2082844170998182350</guid>
        <link>https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind/status/2082844170998182350#m</link>
      </item>
