      <item>
        <title>RT by @GoogleDeepMind: Meet Lyria 3.5, the newest music model from @GoogleDeepMind, now powering Flow Music: 🎤 Vocals: More expressive, dynamic singing 🎸 Musicality: Richer arrangements with tracks that flow naturally. 🎛️ Controls: Better at following creative directions - now featuring BPM control and exportable stems for full-length songs! Try it now at http://flowmusic.google! 🧵</title>
        <dc:creator>@googleflowmusic</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>Meet Lyria 3.5, the newest music model from <a href="https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind" title="Google DeepMind">@GoogleDeepMind</a>, now powering Flow Music:<br>
<br>
🎤 Vocals: More expressive, dynamic singing<br>
🎸 Musicality: Richer arrangements with tracks that flow naturally.<br>
🎛️ Controls: Better at following creative directions - now featuring BPM control and exportable stems for full-length songs!<br>
<br>
Try it now at <a href="http://flowmusic.google">flowmusic.google</a>! 🧵</p>
<a href="https://nitter.net/googleflowmusic/status/2082496617664413721#m">
