      <item>
        <title>Gemini 3.5 Flash Cyber is our specialized, lightweight model built to help security teams spot and patch vulnerabilities before they can be exploited. 🧵</title>
        <dc:creator>@GoogleDeepMind</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>Gemini 3.5 Flash Cyber is our specialized, lightweight model built to help security teams spot and patch vulnerabilities before they can be exploited. 🧵</p>
<video poster="https://nitter.net/pic/tweet_video_thumb%2FHN7JFpBW4AA65NI.jpg" autoplay muted loop style="max-width:250px;">
  <source src="https://nitter.net/pic/video.twimg.com%2Ftweet_video%2FHN7JFpBW4AA65NI.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>]]></description>
        <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:57:54 GMT</pubDate>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">2080321516814647630</guid>
        <link>https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind/status/2080321516814647630#m</link>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title>By combining speed and efficiency, 3.5 Flash Cyber lets defense specialists check significantly more code paths. In testing on our own codebases – including @googlechrome and @Android – it consistently caught complex, unique vulnerabilities that standard models missed.</title>
        <dc:creator>@GoogleDeepMind</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>By combining speed and efficiency, 3.5 Flash Cyber lets defense specialists check significantly more code paths.<br>
<br>
In testing on our own codebases – including <a href="https://nitter.net/googlechrome" title="Chrome">@googlechrome</a> and <a href="https://nitter.net/Android" title="Android">@Android</a> – it consistently caught complex, unique vulnerabilities that standard models missed.</p>
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHN7JKNPWUAAYqbM.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />]]></description>
        <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:57:55 GMT</pubDate>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">2080321519952056441</guid>
        <link>https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind/status/2080321519952056441#m</link>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title>R to @GoogleDeepMind: To ensure this model is deployed responsibly, we’re starting with a limited-access pilot for governments and trusted partners. → https://goo.gle/3T67Ts9</title>
        <dc:creator>@GoogleDeepMind</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>To ensure this model is deployed responsibly, we’re starting with a limited-access pilot for governments and trusted partners. → <a href="https://goo.gle/3T67Ts9">goo.gle/3T67Ts9</a></p>
<hr/>
<b>Link</b><br>
<a href="https://goo.gle/3T67Ts9">
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/card_img%2F2083014654348177408%2FBFF5YR5L%3Fformat%3Djpg%26name%3D800x419" style="max-width:250px;" />
<br>
<b>Introducing Gemini 3.5 Flash Cyber</b>
</a>
<p>Google introduces Gemini 3.5 Flash Cyber to help defenders find, validate, and patch software vulnerabilities quickly and efficiently.</p>
<small><a href="https://goo.gle/3T67Ts9">deepmind.google</a></small>]]></description>
        <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:57:56 GMT</pubDate>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">2080321522040807769</guid>
        <link>https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind/status/2080321522040807769#m</link>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title>We’re expanding our work with the US Dept. of @ENERGY on the Genesis Mission – an initiative to double the pace of scientific discovery within a decade. 🧪 By committing $40M in AI tokens and @GoogleCloud credits, more lab researchers will gain access to Gemini and other AI models. → https://goo.gle/4yGqKKD</title>
        <dc:creator>@GoogleDeepMind</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>We’re expanding our work with the US Dept. of <a href="https://nitter.net/ENERGY" title="U.S. Department of Energy">@ENERGY</a> on the Genesis Mission – an initiative to double the pace of scientific discovery within a decade. 🧪<br>
<br>
By committing $40M in AI tokens and <a href="https://nitter.net/GoogleCloud" title="Google Cloud">@GoogleCloud</a> credits, more lab researchers will gain access to Gemini and other AI models. → <a href="https://goo.gle/4yGqKKD">goo.gle/4yGqKKD</a></p>
<video poster="https://nitter.net/pic/tweet_video_thumb%2FHN1hA97WoAALAhX.jpg" autoplay muted loop style="max-width:250px;">
  <source src="https://nitter.net/pic/video.twimg.com%2Ftweet_video%2FHN1hA97WoAALAhX.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>]]></description>
        <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 13:44:35 GMT</pubDate>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">2079925576077324552</guid>
        <link>https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind/status/2079925576077324552#m</link>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title>RT by @GoogleDeepMind: Fascinating application of @GoogleDeepMind&apos;s AlphaFold in protein engineering! 🧬 As we approach 5 years since the AlphaFold Database was launched, it’s great to see it being used to fill in structural blind spots. While still early, it’s a brilliant example of how open access to AI-predicted structures is empowering experimental biologists to target complex health challenges.</title>
        <dc:creator>@pushmeet</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>Fascinating application of <a href="https://nitter.net/GoogleDeepMind" title="Google DeepMind">@GoogleDeepMind</a>'s  AlphaFold in protein engineering! 🧬<br>
<br>
As we approach 5 years since the AlphaFold Database was launched, it’s great to see it being used to fill in structural blind spots. While still early, it’s a brilliant example of how open access to AI-predicted structures is empowering experimental biologists to target complex health challenges.</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>Bryan Johnson (@bryan_johnson)</b>
<p>
<p>This is great news. <br>
<br>
As you age, sugar binding to your proteins creates stiff, sticky chemical scars that affect skin, arteries, eyes and more. It was considered irreversible and now may be reversible, restoring to a healthy state.<br>
<br>
Researches did this by using AlphaFold to search 45,000 oxidases, then screened more than 500 million engineered variants through directed evolution.<br>
<br>
The work is still ex vivo in a lab setting. Delivering a large bacterial enzyme safely into living tissues, with sufficient penetration and bioavailability, remains a major challenge.</p>
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHNXKpydbwAAu3Vw.png" style="max-width:250px;" />


</p>
<footer>
— <cite><a href="https://nitter.net/bryan_johnson/status/2077789855434879292#m">https://nitter.net/bryan_johnson/status/2077789855434879292#m</a>
</footer>
</blockquote>]]></description>
        <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 11:23:33 GMT</pubDate>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">2079527699157008775</guid>
        <link>https://nitter.net/pushmeet/status/2079527699157008775#m</link>
      </item>
