      <item>
        <title>R to @GoogleDeepMind: It even outperforms 3 Flash on many agentic and coding benchmarks. 3.5 Flash-Lite is rolling out in the @GeminiApp and @Google Search, with API access in @GoogleAIStudio and @AndroidStudio. Find out more → https://goo.gle/4yyNkoi</title>
        <dc:creator>@GoogleDeepMind</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>It even outperforms 3 Flash on many agentic and coding benchmarks.<br>
<br>
3.5 Flash-Lite is rolling out in the <a href="https://nitter.net/GeminiApp" title="Google Gemini">@GeminiApp</a> and <a href="https://nitter.net/Google" title="Google">@Google</a> Search, with API access in <a href="https://nitter.net/GoogleAIStudio" title="Google AI Studio">@GoogleAIStudio</a> and <a href="https://nitter.net/AndroidStudio" title="Android Studio">@AndroidStudio</a>.<br>
<br>
Find out more → <a href="https://goo.gle/4yyNkoi">goo.gle/4yyNkoi</a></p>
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHNxpE8VXMAA_psJ.png" style="max-width:250px;" />

